Third-party software
--------------------
src/llamafactory/ is an unmodified copy of the `src/llamafactory` package of
LLaMA Factory (https://github.com/hiyouga/LLaMA-Factory) at commit
0583d0667648edebde89f6d034b1011e604901ec (25 March 2025). LLaMA Factory is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; its license text is kept at
src/llamafactory/LICENSE and each file keeps its original copyright header.

Third-party data
----------------
jsons/tasks200.json contains small samples of public datasets (MMLU, SQuAD,
SST-2, MultiNLI, ARC and GSM8K). The samples remain under the terms of their
original datasets, which are listed in README.md. The Apache license above
covers the code in this repository, not those samples.
